<title>USA: Control Data gets France Telecom contract.</title>
<headline>Control Data gets France Telecom contract.</headline>
<dateline>ARDEN HILLS, Minn. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Control Data Systems Inc said Wednesday it won a contract from TRANSPAC, a subsidiary of France Telecom to implement the Global Intranet messaging service to manage France Telecom's own disparate messaging systems.</p>
<p>The value of the contract was not disclosed.</p>
<p>Control Data Systems is a software and services company.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
